  "slug": "original-blue-cheese-coleslaw",
  "name": "Original Blue Cheese Coleslaw",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "An easy, fast coleslaw gets a refreshingly tangy blue cheese and lemon dressing. Make it with bagged coleslaw mix.",
  "cuisine": "U.S. American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Lightly mix together the blue cheese, lemon juice, mayonnaise, and salt and pepper in a large salad bowl. Stir in the celery, green onions, and bagged coleslaw, and mix until well-coated."
    }
  ],
